-- Source module: Solutions.KFWC18
/-!
# KFW C-layer 18: the total cost of the entry procedure in the unit

**`ctot_le`**: the cost of `p14Q` is at most `Cn ((k+1) m + 1) n U + q₀ ⌊c_0 n U⌋ + 401 LF`, where
`LF` is the piece sum of the low part.
