# KFW C-layer 19: the closed cost of the entry procedure

**`ctot_closed`**: `cTot ≤ Mb₀ · coefF (18 Kc + 18) K D · n · Xf(r, PsiR r Z, H)`, with `coefF` the
coefficient of `KFM.round_cost_closed` (with `A = A₀`).
